The semi-final match against Nankatsu is almost here.

3
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:06,980
Today, I can say we'll face the biggest obstacle in the tournament.

4
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:11,540
Don't think about tomorrow. Give everything you have today and confront them!

5
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:12,240
Okay!

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,470
Good.

7
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,540
Coach!

8
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,210
What is it, Manager?

9
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:19,410
Yoshiko made headbands for everyone.

10
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:20,250
Oh...

11
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:24,160
No other team had them, so...

12
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,830
Come on, let me see.

13
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:33,300
Wow... It must have been very hard to make this many.

14
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:39,190
By the way, you'll be in the US for the second term, right, Fujisawa?

15
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:41,590
We swore to become national champions

16
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:43,940
to give you a great memory as a farewell gift.

17
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,940
Alright! We'll wear these for today's match!

18
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,330
Yes! Agreed!

19
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:50,130
These are nice!

20
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:51,690
They look cooler than I thought.

21
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,320
We have to stand out sometimes, right?

22
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:54,650
Yes...

23
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:55,930
Here, Oda-kun.

24
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:56,530
Yes.

25
00:00:56,530 --> 00:01:00,410
Yoshiko embroidered each of your numbers on them.

26
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:02,000
Wow, you're right!

27
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,090
Here, Matsuyama-kun.

28
00:01:04,090 --> 00:01:05,810
Oh, thanks!

29
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:12,590
Alright!

30
00:01:13,070 --> 00:01:15,140
We've finally arrived, Nankatsu.

31
00:01:15,140 --> 00:01:17,680
Furano will definitely win!

32
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:20,640
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL
SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

33
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:20,640
Will you really be alright, Tsubasa?

34
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:24,900
Yes. If my ankle is properly taped, I can play as usual.

35
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:26,810
My shoulder is much better.

36
00:01:27,490 --> 00:01:29,160
Anyway, only 2 more matches.

37
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:31,650
Even if my body falls apart, I'll do it.

38
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:35,350
If you're that fired up, Tsubasa, you leave us no choice but to go full speed!

39
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:36,070
Yeah!

40
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,500
Alright!

41
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,070
Let's do this, Matsuyama-kun.

42
00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:48,960
Ai! Ai! Ai!

43
00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:48,960
Love! Love! Love!

