81
00:03:14,210 --> 00:03:19,090
EPISODE 44:
NO. 10 VS. NO. 10

82
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:17,080
The match is about to begin.

83
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:20,470
The second semi-final match of the National Middle School Football Tournament

84
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:23,470
will be between the Hokkaido representatives, Furano,

85
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:26,470
and the Shizuoka representatives, Nankatsu.

86
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:31,980
In the end, which team will face Toho in tomorrow's grand final?

87
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:37,320
Accompanied by loud cheers, both teams take the field.

88
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:41,530
What's this? All members of Furano are wearing headbands as they enter the field.

89
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:45,780
On the other hand, Nankatsu is wearing their own team uniforms.

90
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:48,810
Furano is led by Captain Hikaru Matsuyama.

91
00:03:48,810 --> 00:03:50,160
The one wearing number 10.

92
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:54,920
Nankatsu's leader and captain Tsubasa Ozora also wears number 10.

93
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:59,510
In this game, we have two midfield captains wearing number 10.

94
00:03:59,510 --> 00:04:02,180
Which one will dominate the midfield first?

95
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:06,050
Even if you're injured, I won't hold back, Tsubasa!

96
00:04:06,050 --> 00:04:07,490
Two more...

97
00:04:07,490 --> 00:04:08,900
I will definitely win!

98
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:11,560
I can't afford to lose to anyone in Japan!

99
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:15,350
After the coin toss, it seems Nankatsu will kick off.

100
00:04:15,970 --> 00:04:18,670
Tsubasa, Furano has the goal of taking down Nankatsu,

101
00:04:18,670 --> 00:04:21,280
and today we will fulfill that goal.

102
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:23,780
Matsuyama-kun, I won't lose!

103
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:28,910
Please win, Matsuyama-kun...

104
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:31,910
Tsubasa-kun, I hope your injuries don't get worse...

105
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:35,170
Fight! Fight! Furano!

106
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:38,590
Good luck! Good luck! Nankatsu!

107
00:04:40,460 --> 00:04:44,630
With the referee's whistle, the game finally begins!

108
00:04:45,210 --> 00:04:45,930
Here!

109
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:49,260
The ball was passed to playmaker Tsubasa.

110
00:04:50,450 --> 00:04:51,060
Alright!

111
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:55,580
Tsubasa, if you pass back again,

112
00:04:55,580 --> 00:04:58,590
we'll all attack Nankatsu's goal at once.

113
00:04:58,590 --> 00:05:01,610
We'll show you Furano's Avalanche Attack!

114
00:05:01,610 --> 00:05:03,860
Here I come, Tsubasa!

115
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:07,530
Matsuyama-kun relentlessly attacks Tsubasa-kun!

116
00:05:08,990 --> 00:05:10,260
As I expected, Tsubasa.

117
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:12,220
You knew I couldn't send a pass.

118
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:15,210
But the first move in a tackle is a trap!

119
00:05:15,210 --> 00:05:16,870
Here's the real challenge!

120
00:05:17,470 --> 00:05:20,130
Matsuyama quickly catches him again!

121
00:05:20,130 --> 00:05:21,630
You did it! You got it!

122
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,940
Our captain pulled off that move!

123
00:05:22,940 --> 00:05:24,130
That's his Feinting Tackle!

124
00:05:22,940 --> 00:05:24,130
Feinting Tackle

125
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,130
Alright, let's go!

126
00:05:26,130 --> 00:05:27,130
Yes!

127
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:29,330
Damn it! Well played, Matsuyama-kun.

128
00:05:29,330 --> 00:05:30,890
But I can't lose!

129
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:32,890
Tsubasa-kun gets up immediately and

130
00:05:32,890 --> 00:05:35,020
chases after the dribbling Matsuyama-kun.

131
00:05:35,020 --> 00:05:36,190
Captain, watch out!

132
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:36,850
What?!

133
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:42,690
Thanks to his friend's warning, Matsuyama-kun cleared the ball!

134
00:05:43,690 --> 00:05:44,940
Tsubasa...

135
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:47,520
Take this!

136
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,240
What?!

137
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:48,930
Good!

138
00:05:48,930 --> 00:05:49,950
Ishizaki!

139
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:52,200
I won't lose to Tsubasa!

140
00:05:53,650 --> 00:05:58,560
Tsubasa, you really become fierce when you step onto the field.

141
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:03,340
Considering you have injuries in the match, we'd start to feel pity.

142
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:05,700
Then, I'll ignore your injuries during the match!

143
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:06,380
Here!

144
00:06:06,380 --> 00:06:07,630
Nice pass, Tsubasa!

145
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:09,590
Alright! Go on, Kisugi!

146
00:06:11,470 --> 00:06:13,970
Kisugi-kun's shot deflected off the defender's leg!

147
00:06:13,970 --> 00:06:16,430
And the ball comes right in front of Tsubasa-kun.

148
00:06:16,430 --> 00:06:17,440
Good!

149
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:21,190
Will we soon see Tsubasa's Drive Shot?

150
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:21,190
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

151
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:22,730
As if I'll let you.

152
00:06:23,650 --> 00:06:25,650
Matsuyama-kun blocks!

153
00:06:25,650 --> 00:06:26,570
Matsuyama!

154
00:06:26,570 --> 00:06:29,820
No matter what, I can't let you take the Drive Shot!

155
00:06:26,570 --> 00:06:29,820
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

156
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:33,530
Matsuyama-kun continues the attack.

157
00:06:33,530 --> 00:06:35,830
Tsubasa-kun is right behind him!

158
00:06:38,790 --> 00:06:44,750
This has truly become a fierce power struggle between two midfielders, two number 10s.

159
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:46,070
Tsubasa-kun...

160
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:47,130
Matsuyama-kun...

161
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:54,360
Go, Matsuyama!

162
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,040
Stop him, Tsubasa!

163
00:06:59,140 --> 00:07:01,520
They're kicking at each other's legs!

164
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,680
The ball flies into the air!

165
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,660
Matsuyama-kun...

166
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:05,780
Tsubasa!

167
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:08,860
I won't let you dominate the midfield!

168
00:07:06,610 --> 00:07:08,860
I WON'T LET YOU DOMINATE THE MIDFIELD.

169
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:11,240
Go!

170
00:07:13,110 --> 00:07:14,740
Two tall players collide!

171
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:18,200
Who will gain possession of the ball?

172
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:19,910
Alright!

173
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:21,910
Go on, Izawa!

174
00:07:21,910 --> 00:07:24,440
Football is all about teamwork.

175
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:26,480
If we consider Tsubasa and Matsuyama equal,

176
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:29,260
since Nankatsu has another playmaker like Izawa,

177
00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:31,340
they can gain an advantage here.

178
00:07:31,340 --> 00:07:32,560
Fall back, everyone!

179
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,590
We have to defend!

180
00:07:33,590 --> 00:07:34,930
This is for you, Kisugi!

181
00:07:34,930 --> 00:07:36,060
Take this!

182
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,100
A sliding shot from Kisugi!

183
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:38,970
Damn it!

184
00:07:39,590 --> 00:07:41,480
But Furano blocked it!

185
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:43,230
They completely prevented the goal!

186
00:07:43,230 --> 00:07:44,240
Clear it!

187
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:47,100
Furano escaped this bad situation!

188
00:07:47,910 --> 00:07:48,770
Damn it!

189
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:53,990
Before Matsuyama-kun gets a chance to stop him, Tsubasa-kun sends a pass toward Furano's goal.

190
00:07:53,990 --> 00:07:56,280
Hold on, everyone! We'll get through this!

191
00:07:57,620 --> 00:08:02,790
Izawa uses the pass and jumps to make a header!

192
00:08:04,130 --> 00:08:05,240
Blocked!

193
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:08,130
Goalkeeper Kato barely manages to block it!

194
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:09,760
Nice, Kato!

195
00:08:10,230 --> 00:08:11,050
Captain!

196
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:14,310
You defended our goal well!

197
00:08:14,310 --> 00:08:15,280
Everyone move forward!

198
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:17,050
We're using Furano's Avalanche Attack!

199
00:08:17,050 --> 00:08:17,970
Okay!

200
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:19,180
What?!

201
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:20,770
Did he just say "Avalanche Attack"?

202
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:24,620
Furano, despite their disadvantageous position, quickly runs for a serial counter-attack!

203
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:28,290
All their players are heading towards Nankatsu's goal!

204
00:08:28,290 --> 00:08:29,740
Alright! Let's do this, everyone!

205
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:32,000
I'll send the ball to you.

206
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,220
What a bold tactic!

207
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:39,030
Do they trust Matsuyama-kun's ball control skills that much?

208
00:08:39,590 --> 00:08:41,890
He got past Kisugi and Taki in the blink of an eye!

209
00:08:41,890 --> 00:08:43,120
As expected of Matsuyama-kun!

210
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,980
He's said to be number 1 in ball control skills in the tournament!

211
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:47,540
Ah, Tsubasa-kun is almost there too!

212
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,540
So, before that...

213
00:08:49,710 --> 00:08:52,370
Matsuyama-kun sends a long pass!

214
00:08:52,370 --> 00:08:53,220
Let's go!

215
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:54,090
Okay!

216
00:08:54,090 --> 00:08:56,640
No matter how many there are, there's only one ball!

217
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,390
Just clear it!

218
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:00,870
If they strike before us, we'll follow!

219
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:02,400
Damn it, clear it!

220
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:03,880
Suppress them!

221
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:05,520
What?!

222
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,760
Useless!

223
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:09,860
Even when we clear it, they keep coming one after another!

224
00:09:09,860 --> 00:09:12,040
If you steal the ball from one of us...

225
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,280
Each one of us...

226
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:15,250
Will protect each other!

227
00:09:15,250 --> 00:09:15,910
This...

228
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:16,990
Furano's...

229
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:19,160
Avalanche Attack!

230
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,610
This is Furano's Avalanche Attack!

231
00:09:20,610 --> 00:09:23,290
Will it break through Nankatsu's defense in one go?

232
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:24,130
Take this!

233
00:09:24,130 --> 00:09:26,170
They finally shot the ball towards the goal!

234
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:29,370
Goalkeeper Morisaki cleared it!

235
00:09:29,370 --> 00:09:31,670
Barely escaping this crisis!

236
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:34,930
But both Tsubasa-kun and Matsuyama-kun are running toward the ball!

237
00:09:34,930 --> 00:09:36,470
Which one is faster?

238
00:09:36,470 --> 00:09:37,760
Captain, leave it to us!

239
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,590
Okay!

240
00:09:39,590 --> 00:09:41,930
Matsuyama heads towards the goal!

241
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:42,930
Damn it!

242
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:45,940
Shit!

243
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:49,270
Alright, I'll handle it!

244
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:53,690
The Big 2 of middle school football...

245
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,270
Nankatsu and Toho.

246
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:59,470
Compared to them, the goal-scoring ability Furano clearly lacks.

247
00:09:59,470 --> 00:10:07,510
To fix that, if I want to score as a midfielder, I'll need to be able to make long shots when starting the game.

248
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:10,500
I'm not naturally talented like Tsubasa and Hyuga.

249
00:10:11,140 --> 00:10:12,800
So I'll keep working!

250
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:16,880
The untalented have no choice but to work harder!

251
00:10:25,070 --> 00:10:28,640
Matsuyama-kun puts everything he has into this long shot!

252
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:29,770
Matsuyama-kun!

253
00:10:29,770 --> 00:10:31,440
He used this against Minamiuwa!

254
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,440
Skimming along the ground and leaving a trail of dust behind,

255
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:37,440
this is Matsuyama-kun's thrilling long shot!

256
00:10:41,010 --> 00:10:42,270
It's in!

257
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:44,910
Goalkeeper Morisaki was too slow to react!

258
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:46,600
Furano takes the lead first!

259
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,250
Alright!

260
00:10:47,250 --> 00:10:49,330
I scored a goal, everyone!

261
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:56,510
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

262
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:58,520
You did it, Captain!

263
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,510
Furano finally takes the lead!

264
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:05,970
A magnificent long shot created by training his legs on the rough ground of snowy lands!

265
00:11:05,970 --> 00:11:10,580
Starting with Furano's Avalanche Attack, ending with Matsuyama-kun's "North Country Shot,"

266
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:12,980
they ultimately gained the lead!

267
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:15,170
They did it, Yoshiko!

268
00:11:15,170 --> 00:11:15,940
Yes.

269
00:11:15,940 --> 00:11:17,280
Good!

270
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,280
They caught me.

271
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:22,910
From the look of that shot... You must have trained very hard, Matsuyama-kun.

272
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:23,970
Damn it!

273
00:11:23,970 --> 00:11:26,310
We were the ones applying pressure, and yet...

274
00:11:26,310 --> 00:11:27,270
Damn everything.

275
00:11:27,270 --> 00:11:28,410
Everyone.

276
00:11:28,410 --> 00:11:29,970
Let's renew our spirit.

277
00:11:29,970 --> 00:11:31,970
If we lose today, there is no tomorrow.

278
00:11:31,970 --> 00:11:34,420
Let's do our best to defeat Furano today.

279
00:11:35,010 --> 00:11:39,300
We'll win the unprecedented 3rd victory with our own strength!

280
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:40,630
Yes!

281
00:11:41,870 --> 00:11:43,970
Even though they conceded the first goal,

282
00:11:43,970 --> 00:11:46,560
the Nankatsu players shrugged it off and moved to attack!

283
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,760
They can quickly regain their morale.

284
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:51,020
That's the fearsome part of Nankatsu.

285
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:52,730
Concentrate!

286
00:11:52,730 --> 00:11:53,480
Okay!

287
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:57,520
Captain Tsubasa-kun dribbles the ball by himself!

288
00:11:57,520 --> 00:12:00,160
Alright, leave Tsubasa to me!

289
00:12:01,610 --> 00:12:02,640
Matsuyama-kun!

290
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:03,700
Tsubasa!

291
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:05,120
Take this!

292
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:08,560
Before Matsuyama-kun can reach him, he sends the ball to Taki-kun.

293
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:09,200
That's it.

294
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,330
Keep going, everyone!

295
00:12:10,330 --> 00:12:12,030
Nankatsu's famous offense!

296
00:12:12,030 --> 00:12:14,170
Just one goal! Quickly retaliate!

297
00:12:15,790 --> 00:12:17,270
Furano has done their homework.

298
00:12:17,270 --> 00:12:18,500
Kondo-kun is here to stop him.

299
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:19,880
One guy is no problem...!

300
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:22,550
Kondo-kun stopped him!

301
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:23,840
Nice, Kondo!

302
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:25,550
What–

303
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:29,350
Now here's Ishizaki with a daring lob.

304
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:31,020
Watch me, everyone!

305
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:33,520
This is what you expect from Ryo Ishizaki!

306
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:34,940
Nice lob, Ishizaki!

307
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:36,400
Send it in front of the goal.

308
00:12:37,230 --> 00:12:38,230
There!

309
00:12:38,230 --> 00:12:41,780
Izawa-kun and Nagano-kun, known for their headers, are close to Furano's goal.

310
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:44,150
Tsubasa-kun is also running behind them.

311
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:46,280
Here!

312
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:47,950
Great!

313
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:49,450
Tsubasa uses a header!

314
00:12:49,950 --> 00:12:50,410
Ah!

315
00:12:50,930 --> 00:12:52,020
It didn't go in!

316
00:12:52,020 --> 00:12:54,040
Matsuyama-kun blocked the shot!

317
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:56,540
You fools, watch out!

318
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:59,380
The ball is still in play!

319
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:02,460
Ishizaki fiercely strikes the deflected ball!

320
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,340
Damn it!

321
00:13:03,970 --> 00:13:05,400
So close!

322
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,930
The ball goes out of bounds.

323
00:13:06,930 --> 00:13:09,050
Damn, it was a good chance...

324
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:13,010
Furano continues with a goal kick.

325
00:13:13,010 --> 00:13:13,810
Here!

326
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:16,210
He sends the ball to captain Matsuyama-kun.

327
00:13:16,210 --> 00:13:16,690
Good.

328
00:13:17,270 --> 00:13:20,170
Tsubasa, I won't lose to you when you come to steal the ball.

329
00:13:20,170 --> 00:13:22,400
This time, I'll get past you!

330
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:26,410
Nankatsu sent Captain Tsubasa-kun to mark Matsuyama-kun.

331
00:13:26,410 --> 00:13:30,990
I'll take back the goal we conceded because of my bad decision.

332
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:37,620
Will Tsubasa-kun steal the ball?

333
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:39,960
Yet, Matsuyama-kun doesn't let go of the ball.

334
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:45,090
Captain, pass it!

335
00:13:45,090 --> 00:13:47,930
Please, everyone, trust me on this.

336
00:13:47,930 --> 00:13:51,220
If I can get past Tsubasa here, the rest of the match will flow in our favor!

337
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:56,940
No other players are getting involved in this battle.

338
00:13:56,940 --> 00:13:59,270
Did they leave it to the two of them?

339
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,520
As expected of you, Matsuyama-kun.

340
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,980
What great ball possession skills.

341
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:04,090
He gives me no chance to steal the ball.

342
00:14:04,090 --> 00:14:05,960
Damn it, as expected of you, Tsubasa.

343
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:08,240
He won't let me pass so easily.

344
00:14:13,410 --> 00:14:15,040
At this rate, this will never end...

345
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,210
Time to sink or swim!

346
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,210
TL Note: "sink or swim" idiom.

347
00:14:18,580 --> 00:14:21,570
Ah, Tsubasa-kun lost his balance!

348
00:14:21,570 --> 00:14:23,050
Great, here's my chance!

349
00:14:23,670 --> 00:14:26,050
Matsuyama-kun won't let this chance slip away.

350
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:28,790
What?!

351
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:30,270
He stopped him with his leg!

352
00:14:30,270 --> 00:14:32,440
A trick from Tsubasa-kun!

353
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:36,140
A high-level feint he created himself after entering middle school.

354
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:38,270
He's heading at full speed toward Furano's goal!

355
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:39,690
Get back, everyone!

356
00:14:39,690 --> 00:14:40,720
Damn it!

357
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:44,610
Matsuyama-kun fiercely chases after Tsubasa once the ball was stolen.

358
00:14:44,610 --> 00:14:48,110
Tsubasa prepares for a Drive Shot!

359
00:14:44,610 --> 00:14:48,110
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

360
00:14:48,110 --> 00:14:51,240
I won't let you shoot!

361
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,250
What?!

362
00:14:52,250 --> 00:14:55,370
Matsuyama-kun stopped him once again with a sliding block!

363
00:14:55,370 --> 00:14:57,700
He won't let Tsubasa score.

364
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:00,460
Tsubasa's Drive Shot...

365
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:00,460
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

366
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:02,880
The fact that it takes time to set up the shot,

367
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:05,380
was exposed after he unleashed it.

368
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:07,790
I wouldn't expect anything less from Matsuyama-kun.

369
00:15:07,790 --> 00:15:11,090
But Matsuyama isn't in a position to jump yet!

370
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:12,390
I'm coming!

371
00:15:13,340 --> 00:15:14,180
What?!

372
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:20,310
There! Tsubasa-kun's favorite move after a long time, the Overhead Kick!

373
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:20,310
Overhead Kick

374
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,090
It's in!

375
00:15:27,090 --> 00:15:29,370
He controls the ball and sends it to the right corner.

376
00:15:29,370 --> 00:15:32,450
Tsubasa-kun's Overhead Kick is truly perfect!

377
00:15:29,370 --> 00:15:32,450
Overhead Kick

378
00:15:32,450 --> 00:15:33,950
You did it, Tsubasa!

379
00:15:33,950 --> 00:15:37,800
Nankatsu ties the game in the 28th minute of the first half!

380
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:38,830
Ah...!

381
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:39,620
This is bad!

382
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:41,620
His shoulder will get injured again!

383
00:15:43,830 --> 00:15:44,840
Matsuyama-kun!

384
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:45,840
Tsubasa-kun!

385
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,340
Tsubasa!

386
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:46,830
Captain!

387
00:15:46,830 --> 00:15:48,000
Tsubasa!

388
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,340
Matsuyama-kun!

389
00:15:51,450 --> 00:15:53,400
Damn it, you upset me.

390
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:54,850
But it's still tied!

391
00:15:54,850 --> 00:15:57,600
I will never give up!

392
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,850
Matsuyama-kun...

393
00:15:58,850 --> 00:16:01,800
Matsuyama-kun caught Tsubasa-kun tightly as he fell

394
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:04,800
and saved him from further injuring his shoulder.

395
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:09,150
A wonderful friendship between two players doing their best in a fair match.

396
00:16:10,090 --> 00:16:11,860
Thank you, Matsuyama-kun.

397
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:13,620
You're welcome.

398
00:16:13,620 --> 00:16:16,800
I just want to defeat you when you're in your best condition.

399
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:20,240
The first half ends here!

400
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:22,160
The score is 1-1.

401
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:25,170
Moreover, Tsubasa's injury, which everyone was worried about,

402
00:16:25,170 --> 00:16:28,100
hasn't visibly affected his game, which is reassuring!

403
00:16:29,110 --> 00:16:34,290
An injury isn't something you can beat in a few days.

404
00:16:34,290 --> 00:16:38,210
He may not show it, but he's working hard in this match.

405
00:16:38,210 --> 00:16:41,560
His left foot must be bearing quite a load.

406
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:44,310
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL
SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

407
00:16:42,510 --> 00:16:44,310
Good job, everyone.

408
00:16:44,310 --> 00:16:46,330
Tsubasa, can you continue?

409
00:16:46,330 --> 00:16:47,730
Yes! Everything's fine, sir.

410
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:53,110
FURANO MIDDLE SCHOOL
HOKKAIDO

411
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:55,890
Alright, keep it up and don't lose hope in the second half.

412
00:16:55,890 --> 00:16:57,590
Don't let the heat affect you!

413
00:16:57,590 --> 00:16:58,660
Okay!

414
00:16:58,660 --> 00:17:02,480
If we combine our strength, I'm sure we can win this.

415
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:05,620
When the time comes, I'll score again!

416
00:17:08,590 --> 00:17:10,980
I have to repay their trust in me.

417
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:15,630
I'll settle this with the Drive Shot I completed yesterday.

418
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:15,630
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

419
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:17,630
Tsubasa...

420
00:17:17,630 --> 00:17:19,240
Don't tell me, you...

421
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:23,850
Yoshiko! They caught up to us.

422
00:17:23,850 --> 00:17:25,040
Yes.

423
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:27,850
Don't say "yes" to me, at this rate, Yoshiko...

424
00:17:28,890 --> 00:17:30,200
Matsuyama-kun.

425
00:17:32,300 --> 00:17:34,150
The second half is about to begin.

426
00:17:34,150 --> 00:17:36,990
The clash begins once more, with 30 minutes remaining!

427
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:42,500
Alright, let's go, everyone!

428
00:17:42,500 --> 00:17:43,700
Yes!

429
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:48,750
The two forwards, Kisugi-kun and Oda-kun, clash fiercely with each other at the start!

430
00:17:50,250 --> 00:17:52,480
Nankatsu gets the ball!

431
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:55,590
Tsubasa plays without hesitation while hiding his injuries.

432
00:17:55,590 --> 00:17:56,800
Izawa!

433
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:59,760
The pass reached shadow playmaker Izawa-kun.

434
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:02,350
We have to compensate for Tsubasa's share too!

435
00:18:03,350 --> 00:18:06,850
Nice passing from Nagano, the giant forward, with his masterful header!

436
00:18:06,850 --> 00:18:07,850
Damn it!

437
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:10,110
However, Furano blocks!

438
00:18:10,110 --> 00:18:10,730
Here!

439
00:18:10,730 --> 00:18:12,650
Ishizaki-kun quickly sends the ball upward!

440
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:14,520
Alright! You're doing great, Nankatsu!

441
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:16,400
When it comes to teamwork, we're not unskilled either!

442
00:18:16,940 --> 00:18:20,140
There's no way they can win only with Tsubasa's strength.

443
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:23,330
I mean, after all, this was Nankatsu's true strength from the beginning.

444
00:18:23,330 --> 00:18:24,290
Take this!

445
00:18:24,290 --> 00:18:26,430
As expected, the ball goes to Tsubasa in front of the goal!

446
00:18:26,430 --> 00:18:28,920
I can't let you reach this pass!

447
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:31,050
Everyone created this chance for me.

448
00:18:31,050 --> 00:18:33,420
Even if I can't shoot, I'll make a pass!

449
00:18:34,110 --> 00:18:36,840
Tsubasa-kun struck the ball a second before Matsuyama-kun!

450
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,180
I trust you, Izawa!

451
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:41,850
Even though Tsubasa is injured, he still shows us his best play!

452
00:18:41,850 --> 00:18:44,260
I will definitely score this!

453
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:45,680
I'll reach it!

454
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:48,710
A desperate header from Izawa-kun!

455
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:53,080
It's in!

456
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:57,440
Izawa shows his jumping skills and his Five-Meter Header pierces the net!

457
00:18:57,440 --> 00:19:01,810
Nankatsu finally surpasses the opponent Furano's teamwork and turns the table!

458
00:19:01,810 --> 00:19:02,950
2-1!

459
00:19:02,950 --> 00:19:05,950
This time, Furano will be chasing Nankatsu!

460
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:07,720
You did it, Izawa!

461
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,470
Did you see that?

462
00:19:08,470 --> 00:19:11,650
That's our teamwork!

463
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:12,460
What—

464
00:19:13,470 --> 00:19:14,460
Tsubasa!

465
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:15,460
Tsubasa!

466
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:16,460
Tsubasa-kun!

467
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:17,460
What?!

468
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:22,720
When Tsubasa-kun sent the pass to Izawa-kun, he collided with Matsuyama-kun.

469
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:27,310
They tripped and fell on each other, and it seems he took a blow to his injured left leg.

470
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:28,390
Tsubasa...

471
00:19:28,390 --> 00:19:30,390
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

472
00:19:31,580 --> 00:19:33,100
I'm fine.

473
00:19:33,100 --> 00:19:34,250
More importantly...

474
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:37,900
We're ahead of you now, Matsuyama-kun!

475
00:19:38,580 --> 00:19:39,530
Tsubasa...

476
00:19:41,170 --> 00:19:46,410
I had to stop him completely, but he used just a few centimeters to send a pass.

477
00:19:46,410 --> 00:19:49,190
I made my decision before this match started...

478
00:19:49,190 --> 00:19:51,920
I showed no mercy just because Tsubasa is injured.

479
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:57,500
Tsubasa, from now on, I will completely forget about your injuries.

480
00:19:59,010 --> 00:20:03,000
Initially, I managed to stop the pain by taping my foot properly,

481
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:06,010
but it feels like it's getting worse again.

482
00:20:06,010 --> 00:20:07,760
The match continues.

483
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,090
Let's go, everyone!

484
00:20:09,090 --> 00:20:11,470
We can't give up right after scoring a goal!

485
00:20:11,470 --> 00:20:12,270
Yes!

486
00:20:17,870 --> 00:20:18,910
Damn it!

487
00:20:18,910 --> 00:20:22,200
Does an injured player play like this?!

488
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:25,480
I don't have the energy to try to score more points...

489
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:27,370
What I can do is persistently mark him!

490
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:32,370
Furano continues their one-sided attacks!

491
00:20:32,370 --> 00:20:34,980
However, they can't get even one step closer to Nankatsu's goal!

492
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:36,790
Hold on, Furano!

493
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:40,170
Furano can continue their attacks even without Matsuyama...

494
00:20:40,170 --> 00:20:42,300
However, they lack the ability to score.

495
00:20:42,790 --> 00:20:45,410
Right now, Matsuyama is completely marked.

496
00:20:45,410 --> 00:20:48,310
It will be incredibly difficult for them to score a goal against Nankatsu.

497
00:20:48,310 --> 00:20:50,520
Nankatsu cleared the ball again.

498
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:53,480
Both captains fight for the ball.

499
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:55,870
If I can get there a few seconds before him,

500
00:20:55,870 --> 00:20:58,270
just a few centimeters of space will be enough!

501
00:20:58,270 --> 00:21:00,030
I won't let you shoot!

502
00:21:00,030 --> 00:21:03,030
Tsubasa-kun blocked Matsuyama-kun's shot!

503
00:21:05,370 --> 00:21:08,650
Did Tsubasa injure his left leg again?!

504
00:21:08,650 --> 00:21:09,910
Tsubasa...

505
00:21:10,890 --> 00:21:12,200
Tsubasa!

506
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,700
Are you okay?

507
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:15,610
We don't have much time left.

508
00:21:15,610 --> 00:21:17,500
Nankatsu is really strong.

509
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:19,210
Even though we keep attacking, we can't...

510
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:23,350
Oda, you're going to take the entrance exam for Furano High School, right?

511
00:21:23,350 --> 00:21:25,720
What— Where did this suddenly come from?

512
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:28,920
Yamamuro, you're going to an agricultural high school.

513
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:32,670
You like messing with machines, Wakamatsu. So you're going to a technical high school.

514
00:21:32,670 --> 00:21:37,170
You'll help your family on the farm after middle school, right Kondo?

515
00:21:37,170 --> 00:21:38,230
Captain...

516
00:21:38,230 --> 00:21:41,320
I thought about this before the tournament started.

517
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:46,150
We've been playing football together since elementary school.

518
00:21:46,150 --> 00:21:50,240
But the summer of our third year... This tournament will be the last time.

519
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:56,190
If we lose, this match will be the last match we all play together.

520
00:21:56,190 --> 00:21:57,530
Captain...

521
00:21:57,530 --> 00:22:03,260
That's why... Let's put everything we've won so far into our game and keep fighting!

522
00:22:03,260 --> 00:22:04,190
Everyone!

523
00:22:04,190 --> 00:22:05,550
Captain!

524
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:11,450
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

525
00:22:11,450 --> 00:22:13,730
Yes. I won't lose.

